The key aspect of related marketing is the integration of resources to guide customers towards multiple related products or services.

Option B seems to differ from the others because it focuses on enhancing the experience and showcasing the product's features rather than integrating multiple related products or services together.

Therefore, the option that does not reflect related marketing is:

B) By building an experience space, a TV manufacturer can make customers feel the visual experience brought by the LCD screen, so as to promote the sales of TV sets.

