The context tells us the following:

1. Moneyland operates the most casinos in the state, with 17 casinos.
2. Apex Casinos is trying to acquire the Eldorado chain.
3. To comply with a state law that forbids any owner from operating more than one casino per county, Apex must sell five casinos to complete the acquisition of Eldorado.
4. After selling these five casinos, Apex will still operate 20 casinos in the state.

