- **Option D:** The printing and dyeing factory paid 1 million yuan as a good faith deposit to Aetna trading company, even though they were supposed to pay 1.56 million yuan.

Between Option B and Option D, Option D explicitly mentions the payment as a "good faith deposit to perform the contract," which directly aligns with the definition of a deposit given in the context.

