This option states that historically, oil companies have been the champions of net profit among the world's 500 major companies. While this provides some context about the profitability of oil companies, it doesn't specifically support the claim that Shell's international business is the reason for its high profits. It just says that oil companies generally have high profits, without linking it to international business.

