D) In the past three years, the prices of oil and refined oil have been very stable.
This option suggests that the stability of oil and refined oil prices has been consistent over the past three years. While stable prices might contribute to predictable profits for oil companies, it doesn't specifically highlight the role of international business in Shell's profitability.

